[h1]Less Map Markers [Performance fix] 0.3.0[/h1]

[list]
[*]Replaced construction marker icon lookups with a static generic icon for better performance.
[*]Replaced remaining battle and sound toll concept texture lookups with direct texture paths.
[*]Simplified fort, toll, import/export, raw goods, and blocked vision marker visuals by removing several decorative glow layers.
[*]Restored the holy site marker widget required by EU5 1.2.3.
[/list]
